%E7%9A%84microsoft-autoupdate/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E5%85%B3%E9%97%ADmac%E7%9A%84microsoft-autoupdate/</guid><description>最近使用Office 发现AutoUpdate一直会启动。我也不需要里面的更新。每次还要把它推出。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E5%85%B3%E9%97%ADmac%E7%9A%84microsoft-autoupdate/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>申请Let's Encrypt HTTPS 证书脚本</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7let-s-encrypt-https-%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7let-s-encrypt-https-%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC/</guid><description>简单的说，借助Let’s Encrypt颁发的证书可以为我们的网站免费启用HTTPS(SSL/TLS) 。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7let-s-encrypt-https-%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>GORM 创建联合约束/索引</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/gorm-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F-%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/gorm-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F-%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95/</guid><description>之前提到一个联合约束，那么根据需求再次做一个演示： &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/gorm-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%81%94%E5%90%88%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F-%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>解决约束与软删除冲突</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F-%E8%BD%AF%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F-%E8%BD%AF%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81/</guid><description>本咸鱼对数据库方面研究甚少。能存数据就没多考虑其他问题。尤其是在设计方面。都是按照接口或者业务推到一下就好了。 这次考虑一个问题，学习了一个小问题的处理。 就是标题所述 约束与软删除的冲突。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F-%E8%BD%AF%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Linux重启后Docker设置自动启动&amp;容器自动启动设置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8Edocker%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8-%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8Edocker%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8-%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>系统重启后，如果docker没有启动，那么docker下所有的服务就都挂了。 配置过一次总是忘记命令，这里特意记录一下： systemctl enable docker.service &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/linux%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8Edocker%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8-%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>解决MAC软件提示已损坏或移到废纸篓</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3mac%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%B7%B2%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%E6%88%96%E7%A7%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%9F%E7%BA%B8%E7%AF%93/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Feb 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3mac%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%B7%B2%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%E6%88%96%E7%A7%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%9F%E7%BA%B8%E7%AF%93/</guid><description>macOS Catalina 10.15.1 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3mac%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E5%B7%B2%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%E6%88%96%E7%A7%BB%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%9F%E7%BA%B8%E7%AF%93/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mac book pro 终端走代理配置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/mac-book-pro-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E8%B5%B0%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/mac-book-pro-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E8%B5%B0%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>前提是你已经知道怎么使用shadowsocks软件，并且可以出去之后。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/mac-book-pro-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E8%B5%B0%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Golang 环境准备</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/golang-%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/golang-%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87/</guid><description>&amp;#34;Golang 环境准备&amp;#34; &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/golang-%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>golang.org/x/xerrors：undefined: errors.Frame</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/golang-org-x-xerrorsundefined-errors-frame/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/golang-org-x-xerrorsundefined-errors-frame/</guid><description>&amp;#34;golang.org/x/xerrors：undefined: errors.Frame&amp;#34; &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/golang-org-x-xerrorsundefined-errors-frame/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>yarn install phantomjs-prebuilt: Command failed.</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/yarn-install-phantomjs-prebuilt-command-failed/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/yarn-install-phantomjs-prebuilt-command-failed/</guid><description>自己在项目中发现执行 yarn install时候，一直卡住没走完。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/yarn-install-phantomjs-prebuilt-command-failed/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>MySQL5.7修改root密码</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/mysql5-7%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9root%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/mysql5-7%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9root%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81/</guid><description>最近维护一个MySQL数据库，由于各种原因，密码已经不知道了。现在让我在这台服务器上使用里面的MySQL数据库。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/mysql5-7%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9root%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Prometheus-SNMP_Exporter Generator</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-snmp-exporter-generator/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Dec 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-snmp-exporter-generator/</guid><description>之前在说Prometheus-snmpexport部署时,没有具体提到snmp.yml的生成器是怎么生成的.几乎用的都是github上的snmp.yml文件(只在demo中添加了auth配置). &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-snmp-exporter-generator/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Prometheus告警模板详解</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E5%91%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E5%91%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/</guid><description>之前配置告警之后,可以发送告警信息.但对于数据具体的结构信息,在模板中数据读取都比较懵.原因是不太清除警报都提供了哪些数据,除了我们设置的信息,还有没有其他的信息. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E5%91%8A%E8%AD%A6%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Prometheus标签处理&amp;服务发现</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 Dec 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0/</guid><description>之前的配置中提到了标签的处理,不过由于写的是静态的配置,标签可以自己设置或者不设置都可以. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86-%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>M3DB笔记</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/m3db%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/m3db%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/</guid><description>前阵子研究prometheus,初期没有考虑存储问题.本地默认存储30天数据. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/m3db%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>网络传输速度测试工具</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BC%A0%E8%BE%93%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BC%A0%E8%BE%93%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/</guid><description>最近公司测试限速,搜集软件发现两款,iperf,LANSpeedTest. iperf,多平台. LANSpeedTest,读写显示,操作简单. 局域网测试传输,优先考虑UDP. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E4%BC%A0%E8%BE%93%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Prometheus-AlertManager警告管理搭建与配置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-alertmanager%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-alertmanager%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>通过翻译官方文档可以了解到,AlertManager是负责为Prometheus(本身不会发送警报)发送警报的工具. AlertManager不是简单发送警报,可以消除重复警报,分组,抑制警报功能.并支持多接收器. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometheus-alertmanager%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>windows10家庭版启用组策略gpedit.msc</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/windows10%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E7%89%88%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E7%BB%84%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5gpedit-msc/</link><pubDate>Tue, 15 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/windows10%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E7%89%88%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E7%BB%84%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5gpedit-msc/</guid><description>家庭版很多功能不能使用,凑巧用的就是家庭版. 还想使用gpedit.msc来关闭windows10的更新. 找到一个可行的方法. &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/windows10%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E7%89%88%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E7%BB%84%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5gpedit-msc/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>curl: (3) Illegal characters found in URL</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/curl-3-illegal-characters-found-in-url/</link><pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/curl-3-illegal-characters-found-in-url/</guid><description>昨天在服务器上执行一个脚本,在linux新建的sh,把本地编辑器的内容粘贴到文件里. 结果执行的时候报错了. 问题就是 curl:(3)Illegal characters found in URL &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/curl-3-illegal-characters-found-in-url/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Prometueus.yml配置文件说明</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometueus-yml%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</link><pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometueus-yml%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</guid><description>prometueus.yml 配置文件注解与说明 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/prometueus-yml%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>yaml规则</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/yaml%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/yaml%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99/</guid><description>最近经常配置一些服务，发现大部分都是yml类型文件。小记一下。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/yaml%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Grafana中文化</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/grafana%E6%B1%89%E5%8C%96/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/grafana%E6%B1%89%E5%8C%96/</guid><description>Grafana是一个通用的可视化工具。通过Grafana可以管理用户权限，数据分析，查看，导出，设置告警等。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/grafana%E6%B1%89%E5%8C%96/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Centos7安装nodejs</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85nodejs/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85nodejs/</guid><description>wget https://nodejs.org/dist/v10.16.3/node-v10.16.3-linux-x64.tar.xz &lt;a href="https://b