用户 5 - 图形界面 6 - 系统正常关闭并重新启动 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/centos7%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E7%AD%89%E7%BA%A7%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker常用命令</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/docker%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/docker%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>说常用不如说自己用到的命令。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/docker%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ubutun下安装Docker</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun%E4%B8%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85docker/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun%E4%B8%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85docker/</guid><description>具体信息请参考官方。官方概述（养成看文档习惯） &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/ubutun%E4%B8%8B%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85docker/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item><item><title>Hexo博客安装与配置</title><link>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/hexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/hexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>wordpress 使用很方便，但是折腾几次之后。由于一次意外，导致管理者把我的vps被停掉。虽然有些文章还是保留了。但是这次之后感觉自己还是找一个稳妥的家。连接hexo搭建的博客之后，打算自己来折腾一下。 &lt;a href="https://blog.51ai.vip/posts/hexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/"&gt;阅读全文 →&lt;/a&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>